WEBVTT

00:15:01.166 --> 00:15:08.103
(Music)

00:15:17.879 --> 00:15:21.369
CA: Talk a bit about social stimulation
versus other types of stimulation.

00:15:21.393 --> 00:15:26.146
Like, certainly speaking personally,
stimulation that is non-people-based,

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:30.560
it's not the loud party or the bar where
you have to make clever, cool small talk.